calable Architecture, \nConcurrency Control \nWORK EXPERIENCE \nFull Stack Developer — Numeric Infosystem Pvt Ltd Oct 2025 – Present \n• Design and develop scalable full-stack web applications serving 100+ active users, including a full Employee & HR \nManagement System with role-based Admin and Employee panels, custom MySQL schema, and REST API layer. \n• Build an employee attendance web and mobile app (check-in/check-out, working-hours calculation, late tracking, monthly \nsummaries) end-to-end across frontend, backend, and database, reducing manual attendance processing time by 50%. \n• Develop resume management and advanced resume-search functionality with multi-filter search, status tracking, and Excel \nexport, cutting recruiter screening time by 40%. \n• Implement AI-based resume autofill that automatically extracts candidate details from uploaded resumes, reducing \nmanual data entry by 70%. \n• Build interactive report dashboards for attendance, leave, payroll, and recruitment insights, backed by custom SQL \naggregation queries, and integrate secure JSON Web Token (JWT) authentication with third-party APIs (Google, SMS, \nGmail). \n• Collaborate cross-functionally with design and backend teams to deliver features on schedule. \nSoftware Development Intern — PS Softech Jan 2025 – Sep 2025 \n• Developed and maintained 100+ front-end modules using React.js and Material UI, improving component reusability \nacross the codebase. \n• Collaborated with backend developers on Node.js API design and integration, validating and testing 120+ endpoints using \nPostman. \n• Identified and resolved 180+ bugs during feature implementation and performance-optimization cycles across the full \nstack. \n• Contributed to mobile app feature development using React Native, supporting delivery of 10 releases. \nPROJECTS \nJobSpiders — Full Stack Job Portal Application  |  jobspiders.com \n• Developed and deployed a full-stack job portal using React.js, Node.js, and Express.js, supporting 10,000+ registered users. \n\n• Implemented RESTful APIs, CRUD operations, and secure JSON Web Token (JWT) authentication for candidate account and \nprofile management. \n• Built advanced job filtering and search functionality, improving job-discovery relevance for candidates. \n• Designed a candidate dashboard for job tracking, application status, and profile management; optimized API response \ntime by 40%. \nTelegram Cloud Storage — Full Stack Cloud Storage Platform  |  telegramcloudstorage.vercel.app \n• Architected and built a full-stack cloud storage application using Node.js, Express.js, MySQL, TypeScript, and \n@mtcute/node, using Telegram\'s infrastructure to provide free, unlimited-scale file storage. \n• Migrated the backend from GramJS to @mtcute/node to enable true streaming uploads/downloads instead of buffering \nfull files in memory, significantly improving performance for large-file transfers. \n• Engineered real-time upload progress tracking using Server-Sent Events (SSE), with support for mid-transfer upload \ncancellation. \n• Designed and implemented a custom rate limiter and concurrency-limiter middleware to control API load, prevent abuse, \nand keep the app stable under concurrent uploads. \n• Built channel synchronization, drag-and-drop uploads, inline rename, and a mobile-responsive User Interface (UI) (custom \nhamburger menu via React portal). \n• Deployed and hosted the full application independently; documented the architecture and build process in a portfolio case \nstudy. \nSalesBuddy  |  github.com/Rohan2519Y/Sales-Buddy \n• Built a full-stack marketplace application using React.js, Node.js, and Express.js with integrated payment gateway support. \n• Implemented secure RESTful authentication and role-based access, improving user session security. \n• Delivered a fully responsive User Interface (UI), improving usability and engagement across mobile and desktop. \nElectronics App  |  github.com/Rohan2519Y/electronicsapp \n• Built a cross-platform e-commerce app using React Native, Node.js, and Express.js. \n• Implemented Async Storage, secure authentication, and third-party payment/API integrations for a seamless checkout \nflow. \nEDUCATION \nBachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) — ITM University, Gwalior 2025–2028 (Pursuing) \nClass 12th (CBSE) — Amar Public School — 75% \nClass 10th (CBSE) — Ramkrishna Mission — 75% \nACHIEVEMENTS \n• Selected as a participant in Smart India Hackathon, a national-level government innovation competition. \n• Secured 3rd Place in the Inter-College Coding Competition, demonstrating strong problem-solving and programming skills. \nCERTIFICATIONS \n• Full Stack Web Development Certificate — (PS Softech, 2025) \n• React (Basic, Intermediate) Certificate — HackerRank, 2025 \nLANGUAGES \nEnglish: Basic     Hindi: Native','2026-11-03 08:42:54',5,'372ae0b36277d168a5fb4abe20c613f15e46dcc503dbf11438280209d7663027','{\"projects\": [{\"name\": \"JobSpiders\", \"description\": \"Full stack job portal application developed with React.js, Node.js, and Express.js supporting 10,000+ registered users.\"}, {\"name\": \"Telegram Cloud Storage\", \"description\": \"Full stack cloud storage application architected with Node.js and Express.js, offering unlimited-scale file storage.\"}, {\"name\": \"SalesBuddy\", \"description\": \"Full stack marketplace application with integrated payment gateway support.\"}, {\"name\": \"Electronics App\", \"description\": \"Cross-platform e-commerce app developed using React Native.\"}], \"sections\": [\"PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\", \"TECHNICAL SKILLS\", \"WORK EXPERIENCE\", \"PROJECTS\", \"EDUCATION\", \"ACHIEVEMENTS\", \"CERTIFICATIONS\", \"LANGUAGES\"], \"education\": [{\"year\": \"2025–2028 (Pursuing)\", \"degree\": \"Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA)\", \"institution\": \"ITM University, Gwalior\"}], \"experience\": [{\"role\": \"Full Stack Developer\", \"company\": \"Numeric Infosystem Pvt Ltd\", \"duration\": \"Oct 2025 – Presen