erience\n- Model deployment (FastAPI, Docker)\n- SQL and data pipelines\n- Strong statistics foundation','2026-10-31 08:53:06','Acme Technologies','[\"Python\", \"PyTorch\", \"scikit-learn\", \"NLP\", \"FastAPI\", \"Docker\"]','[\"SQL\", \"Statistics\"]',1),(6,'UI/UX Designer','Pune, India','Design intuitive product experiences.\n\nKey requirements:\n- Figma and prototyping\n- User research and usability testing\n- Design systems\n- Wireframing and information architecture\n- Collaboration with engineers','2026-10-31 08:53:06','Acme Technologies','[\"Figma\", \"Prototyping\", \"User Research\", \"Design Systems\", \"Wireframing\"]','[\"Usability Testing\"]',1);
